IVX of Demetrescu, Rodrigues and Taylor (2023), eqs (4.9), (4.11) and (5.5)-(5.7):
the single-period response is regressed on the \eqn{h}-period transformed
instrument \eqn{z_t^{trf,(h)} = \sum_{i=\max(1,t-h+1)}^{\min(t,T-h)} z_i}
